    "A PDF of what was given and when, over the last days or weeks — the answer to the first question in the consulting room.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein PDF darüber, was wann gegeben wurde, über die letzten Tage oder Wochen — die Antwort auf die erste Frage im Sprechzimmer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A PDF of what was given and when, over the last days or weeks — the answer to the first question in the consulting room."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un PDF de qué se dio y cuándo, en los últimos días o semanas: la respuesta a la primera pregunta en la consulta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dose below was ticked off by more than one person. Check with the others before giving anything else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Gabe unten wurde von mehreren Personen abgehakt. Sprich dich mit den anderen ab, bevor du weiter gibst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A dose below was ticked off by more than one person. Check with the others before giving anything else."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una dosis de abajo fue marcada por más de una persona. Habla con los demás antes de administrar nada más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A low reading is not a mistake — it is the reason for writing it down. Only a value above 100 % is flagged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein niedriger Wert ist kein Fehler — er ist der Grund, ihn aufzuschreiben. Gewarnt wird nur über 100 %."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A low reading is not a mistake — it is the reason for writing it down. Only a value above 100 % is flagged."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un valor bajo no es un error: es la razón para anotarlo. Solo se avisa por encima del 100 %."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above 100 % is not a reading.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Über 100 % ist kein Messwert."
