    "There are no medications in the plan yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Plan steht noch kein Medikament."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no medications in the plan yet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todavía no hay medicamentos en el plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This lists what was recorded in the app, not what was observed. A dose shown as “not recorded” may well have been given without anybody reaching for their phone. Times come from the phone of whoever ticked the dose off. DosiCrew does not check doses, interactions or contraindications.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hier steht, was in der App eingetragen wurde, nicht was beobachtet wurde. Eine als „nicht eingetragen“ ausgewiesene Gabe kann sehr wohl gegeben worden sein, ohne dass jemand zum Telefon gegriffen hat. Die Zeiten stammen vom Telefon derjenigen Person, die abgehakt hat. DosiCrew prüft keine Dosierungen, Wechselwirkungen oder Gegenanzeigen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This lists what was recorded in the app, not what was observed. A dose shown as “not recorded” may well have been given without anybody reaching for their phone. Times come from the phone of whoever ticked the dose off. DosiCrew does not check doses, interactions or contraindications."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí figura lo que se registró en la app, no lo que se observó. Una dosis marcada como «sin registrar» bien puede haberse administrado sin que nadie cogiera el teléfono. Las horas provienen del teléfono de quien la marcó. DosiCrew no comprueba dosis, interacciones ni contraindicaciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time given": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
