    "iCloud is not available right now. Everything is saved on this iPhone, but nothing is being shared — the others cannot see what you tick off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud ist gerade nicht verfügbar. Alles wird auf diesem iPhone gespeichert, aber nichts wird geteilt — die anderen sehen nicht, was du abhakst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud is not available right now. Everything is saved on this iPhone, but nothing is being shared — the others cannot see what you tick off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud no está disponible ahora mismo. Todo se guarda en este iPhone, pero no se comparte nada: los demás no ven lo que marcas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS did not ask again. Only removing DosiCrew and installing it afresh resets that. The plan itself is in iCloud and comes back; only the name in these settings has to be typed again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS hat nicht erneut gefragt. Das lässt sich nur zurücksetzen, indem DosiCrew gelöscht und neu installiert wird. Der Plan liegt in iCloud und kommt zurück; nur der Name in diesen Einstellungen muss neu eingetragen werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS did not ask again. Only removing DosiCrew and installing it afresh resets that. The plan itself is in iCloud and comes back; only the name in these settings has to be typed again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS no volvió a preguntar. Solo se restablece borrando DosiCrew e instalándola de nuevo. El plan está en iCloud y vuelve; solo hay que escribir otra vez el nombre en estos ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
